1
00:01:42,700 --> 00:01:48,020
[When I Meet The Moon]

2
00:01:48,090 --> 00:01:51,060
[Episode 17]

3
00:01:51,289 --> 00:01:54,190
[Steal A Moment To Sip Wine Guesthouse]

4
00:01:58,090 --> 00:01:59,000
Have one.

5
00:01:59,930 --> 00:02:01,590
I just can't get over it.

6
00:02:01,850 --> 00:02:03,090
If he has plans with someone else,

7
00:02:03,090 --> 00:02:05,090
why did he wait for me to get off work?

8
00:02:05,450 --> 00:02:07,730
Didn't they say there's a pervert around?

9
00:02:07,730 --> 00:02:08,840
He was worried about you,

10
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:10,440
so he wanted to walk you home.

11
00:02:10,460 --> 00:02:12,060
Who asked for his concern?

12
00:02:12,900 --> 00:02:13,750
I finally

13
00:02:13,750 --> 00:02:15,090
strengthened my emotional armor.

14
00:02:15,090 --> 00:02:15,740
But he...

15
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:16,820
As soon as I saw him,

16
00:02:16,820 --> 00:02:18,230
it... it collapsed.

17
00:02:20,090 --> 00:02:21,360
If he'd just ignored me

18
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,250
from beginning to end,

19
00:02:22,250 --> 00:02:24,150
I might've moved on long ago.

20
00:02:24,300 --> 00:02:25,690
That's not how it works.

21
00:02:26,030 --> 00:02:27,240
If he didn't come to you,

22
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,560
you'd be moping again.

23
00:02:30,480 --> 00:02:32,480
Ugh, I don't know what to do with him.

24
00:02:38,860 --> 00:02:39,650
You see,

25
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:41,360
he dressed up so nicely

26
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:42,690
and even ordered flowers.

27
00:02:42,690 --> 00:02:43,340
After work,

28
00:02:43,340 --> 00:02:44,690
he should've just gone on his date.

29
00:02:44,690 --> 00:02:45,530
Why did he wait for me?

30
00:02:45,530 --> 00:02:46,430
Does he pity me?

31
00:02:49,060 --> 00:02:49,650
Am I,

32
00:02:49,650 --> 00:02:51,530
Yun Li, someone

33
00:02:51,530 --> 00:02:52,900
at his beck and call?

34
00:02:53,740 --> 00:02:54,530
You are.

35
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:55,710
Tang Lin,

36
00:02:55,710 --> 00:02:57,460
whose side are you on?

37
00:02:58,090 --> 00:02:59,250
Alright, Lili.

38
00:02:59,300 --> 00:03:00,250
I'm 100% on your side,

39
00:03:00,250 --> 00:03:01,430
of course.

40
00:03:01,530 --> 00:03:02,500
But seriously,

41
00:03:02,530 --> 00:03:03,740
haven't you considered

42
00:03:03,740 --> 00:03:05,940
you might be the one he wanted to ask out?

43
00:03:07,410 --> 00:03:08,610
How's that possible?

44
00:03:08,630 --> 00:03:09,690
They said that woman

45
00:03:09,690 --> 00:03:10,750
has known him for years.

46
00:03:10,750 --> 00:03:11,960
How could it be me?

47
00:03:13,300 --> 00:03:14,130
Huh?

48
00:03:14,130 --> 00:03:15,800
That was what others said.

49
00:03:15,930 --> 00:03:17,530
You have to ask him in person.

50
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:19,690
I've been chasing him for so long,

51
00:03:19,690 --> 00:03:20,820
and he kept rejecting me.

52
00:03:20,820 --> 00:03:22,880
He refused every time I asked him out.

53
00:03:25,650 --> 00:03:27,870
Besides, he hasn't reached out to me

54
00:03:27,870 --> 00:03:29,090
for so long.

55
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,180
I bet he doesn't even know

56
00:03:30,180 --> 00:03:31,510
I deleted him on WeChat.

57
00:03:32,090 --> 00:03:33,820
You even deleted him on WeChat?

58
00:03:36,860 --> 00:03:37,630
You two still

59
00:03:37,630 --> 00:03:39,090
work in the same company.

60
00:03:39,090 --> 00:03:40,630
Interactions are inevitable.

61
00:03:40,630 --> 00:03:42,090
Isn't it awkward?

62
00:03:43,130 --> 00:03:45,190
Actually, I regret it a little bit.

63
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:47,500
Should I add him back?

64
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:50,150
He probably didn't even notice.

65
00:03:52,750 --> 00:03:53,860
But what if he did?

66
00:03:53,860 --> 00:03:55,590
Wouldn't that be more awkward?

67
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:56,590
Forget it.

68
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:58,630
Actually, for you two,

69
00:03:58,630 --> 00:04:01,030
having clear boundaries isn't a bad thing.

70
00:04:01,030 --> 00:04:02,250
There are plenty of good men around.

71
00:04:02,250 --> 00:04:02,860
There's no need

72
00:04:02,860 --> 00:04:04,300
to pine away for one guy.

73
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:09,840
In that case, are you still

74
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,570
going to that hot spring hotel?

75
00:04:11,740 --> 00:04:13,000
What hot spring hotel?

76
00:04:13,620 --> 00:04:15,460
The year-end party Xia invited us to.

77
00:04:15,460 --> 00:04:16,450
I wonder if

78
00:04:16,450 --> 00:04:17,430
Fu Shize will go.

79
00:04:17,540 --> 00:04:18,660
But if you don't want to go...

80
00:04:18,660 --> 00:04:20,240
I didn't say I wouldn't go.

81
00:04:20,430 --> 00:04:22,040
Am I that petty?

82
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,560
You said it yourself—

83
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,860
it's just normal interaction
between colleagues.

84
00:04:27,860 --> 00:04:29,540
What's wrong with colleagues going on

85
00:04:29,540 --> 00:04:30,870
a team-building event?

86
00:04:30,890 --> 00:04:31,690
It's fine.

87
00:04:31,830 --> 00:04:32,630
I'll just ask Xia

88
00:04:32,630 --> 00:04:33,430
to invite two single

89
00:04:33,430 --> 00:04:34,560
colleagues to join us...

90
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,300
No!

91
00:04:35,890 --> 00:04:37,490
If you bring them, I won't go.

92
00:04:52,470 --> 00:04:52,970
Yun Ye,

93
00:04:53,230 --> 00:04:54,760
I'm so done with you.

94
00:04:55,010 --> 00:04:57,010
Report to me as soon as class is over.

95
00:05:10,990 --> 00:05:11,800
Hey, Li.

96
00:05:11,950 --> 00:05:12,950
Don't tell me

97
00:05:12,950 --> 00:05:14,570
you just saw my text.

98
00:05:15,420 --> 00:05:16,280
I've been busy.

99
00:05:16,340 --> 00:05:18,620
I had consecutive exams
in Chinese, English,

100
00:05:18,620 --> 00:05:20,090
and Physics just days ago.

101
00:05:20,620 --> 00:05:22,500
I barely have any brain cells left.

102
00:05:22,500 --> 00:05:23,560
You're so busy,

103
00:05:23,660 --> 00:05:25,990
yet you still have time to send postcards?

104
00:05:27,370 --> 00:05:28,610
Wait, how do you know?

105
00:05:28,980 --> 00:05:31,180
Her brother came to me

106
00:05:31,180 --> 00:05:32,010
just to ask if

107
00:05:32,010 --> 00:05:33,570
you were the one sending his sister

108
00:05:33,570 --> 00:05:34,560
postcards.

109
00:05:34,620 --> 00:05:35,659
Sending them every week,

110
00:05:35,659 --> 00:05:37,310
you're quite persistent, huh?

111
00:05:37,310 --> 00:05:38,120
Wait,

112
00:05:38,810 --> 00:05:40,270
how did her brother know

113
00:05:40,270 --> 00:05:41,120
it was me?

114
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,180
Ten postcards,

115
00:05:43,450 --> 00:05:45,770
all with the exact same handwriting.

116
00:05:45,890 --> 00:05:47,220
What were you thinking?

117
00:05:48,690 --> 00:05:50,290
Her brother read my letters?

118
00:05:50,870 --> 00:05:51,810
I also think

119
00:05:51,830 --> 00:05:53,120
he read your letters.

120
00:05:53,659 --> 00:05:56,420
No way, that's too shameless.

121
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,620
It is, a little.

122
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,370
But Yun Ye,

123
00:05:59,370 --> 00:05:59,950
what if

124
00:05:59,950 --> 00:06:00,480
this

125
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:02,220
affects the girl's grades?

126
00:06:02,420 --> 00:06:03,480
You still need to, you know,

127
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,570
tone it down a bit.

128
00:06:05,270 --> 00:06:06,120
No, no, no.

129
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:06,860
Yun Li,

130
00:06:06,990 --> 00:06:08,920
your brother's letters were read,

131
00:06:09,060 --> 00:06:10,660
and you won't stand up for me?

132
00:06:10,660 --> 00:06:11,450
Yun Ye,

133
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:12,750
prolonged one-sided giving

134
00:06:12,750 --> 00:06:14,750
is a recipe for hurt and heartbreak.

135
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,750
You need to love yourself more, you know?

136
00:06:16,750 --> 00:06:17,360
Wait,

137
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,450
how am I hurt?

138
00:06:18,500 --> 00:06:19,920
She tutored me in math,

139
00:06:19,950 --> 00:06:21,480
so my grades even improved.

140
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:23,360
Li,

141
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:25,220
why are you suddenly saying this?

142
00:06:26,620 --> 00:06:27,560
It's just advice

143
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:29,690
from someone who's been there.

144
00:06:31,580 --> 00:06:33,870
That guy doesn't like you?

145
00:06:35,950 --> 00:06:37,880
Let's go back to talking about you.

146
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:40,750
I think her family
doesn't plan to interfere,

147
00:06:40,750 --> 00:06:42,600
as long as it doesn't affect her studies.

148
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:43,250
He just

149
00:06:43,250 --> 00:06:44,580
came to me to confirm it.

150
00:06:45,030 --> 00:06:46,430
Does that mean I can

151
00:06:46,450 --> 00:06:47,620
keep sending postcards?

152
00:06:47,620 --> 00:06:49,630
I don't support teenage dating.

153
00:06:51,390 --> 00:06:53,800
If there's nothing else, I'll hang up.

154
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:54,500
Bye.

155
00:07:05,740 --> 00:07:06,740
Let me do it, Lili.

156
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:08,390
Thanks.

157
00:07:08,830 --> 00:07:10,430
Yesterday, I saw a drone

158
00:07:10,430 --> 00:07:11,360
in your video.

159
00:07:11,390 --> 00:07:12,560
Is it for my uncle?

160
00:07:14,190 --> 00:07:15,000
Yes,

161
00:07:15,430 --> 00:07:17,430
but I'm not giving it to him anymore.

162
00:07:18,490 --> 00:07:20,060
Did you have a fight?

163
00:07:20,430 --> 00:07:21,240
No.

164
00:07:21,630 --> 00:07:23,330
I just don't want to anymore.

165
00:07:23,930 --> 00:07:25,250
Did Uncle do something

166
00:07:25,250 --> 00:07:27,100
to upset you?

167
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:30,100
Yun Li.

168
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,500
Qingsong, hang on.

169
00:07:31,500 --> 00:07:31,890
I still

170
00:07:31,890 --> 00:07:33,550
have something to say to Lili.

171
00:07:40,060 --> 00:07:40,890
Fu Zhengchu,

172
00:07:41,770 --> 00:07:43,770
is there a woman who your uncle has

173
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:44,950
known for a long time

174
00:07:45,250 --> 00:07:47,000
and is very close to?

175
00:07:47,890 --> 00:07:48,690
Lili,

176
00:07:48,930 --> 00:07:50,750
do you think Uncle

177
00:07:50,930 --> 00:07:52,130
likes someone else?

178
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:54,100
I'm just asking.

179
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:58,070
The only girls and women around him

180
00:07:58,100 --> 00:07:59,830
are blood-related

181
00:07:59,830 --> 00:08:00,740
relatives.

182
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:01,950
And don't worry.

183
00:08:01,950 --> 00:08:02,630
There's no way

184
00:08:02,630 --> 00:08:03,830
he likes anyone else.

185
00:08:04,250 --> 00:08:05,160
Are you sure?

186
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,100
Of course.

187
00:08:08,030 --> 00:08:08,830
Uncle!

188
00:08:15,570 --> 00:08:16,130
Uncle.

189
00:08:16,190 --> 00:08:17,190
What drinks did you get?

190
00:08:17,190 --> 00:08:17,950
I want one.

191
00:08:18,690 --> 00:08:19,500
Get in.

192
00:08:21,430 --> 00:08:22,930
Do you have to be so stingy?

193
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,220
Let's get in, Lili.

194
00:08:39,530 --> 00:08:40,460
Chocolate milk.

195
00:08:41,789 --> 00:08:43,600
No thanks. I'll just have water.

196
00:08:46,550 --> 00:08:47,700
Is everyone here?

197
00:08:47,940 --> 00:08:49,050
Let's set off then.

198
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,400
What's wrong, Yun Li?

199
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:57,650
Mr. Xu, your clothes

200
00:08:57,650 --> 00:08:59,050
are quite fancy.

201
00:09:00,550 --> 00:09:01,360
Are they?

202
00:09:02,050 --> 00:09:03,290
They look good on you.

203
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:06,360
I've always thought

204
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:08,550
Shize dresses too plainly.

205
00:09:08,650 --> 00:09:09,750
I tried giving him some clothes,

206
00:09:09,750 --> 00:09:11,100
but he refused them all.

207
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,200
Why?

208
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,960
Because Uncle thinks they're ugly.

209
00:09:17,030 --> 00:09:18,690
Will it kill you to stay quiet?

210
00:09:19,030 --> 00:09:20,050
Just drive.

211
00:09:20,460 --> 00:09:21,500
We're off.

212
00:09:39,530 --> 00:09:40,790
This place looks nice.

213
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:42,550
Yeah? Does it meet your standards?

214
00:09:42,550 --> 00:09:44,250
My bro does have good taste.

215
00:09:50,030 --> 00:09:51,550
I... I can do it myself.

216
00:09:58,070 --> 00:09:58,780
Tangy, Xia.

217
00:09:58,810 --> 00:10:00,810
Lili, why are you so late?

218
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:01,840
I...

219
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:02,790
Where are the rest?

220
00:10:02,790 --> 00:10:04,100
They're right behind.

221
00:10:05,890 --> 00:10:06,470
Lili,

222
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:07,610
you're so fast!

223
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:08,740
Lili,

224
00:10:08,740 --> 00:10:09,940
let me introduce you.

225
00:10:09,940 --> 00:10:11,360
This is Chen Renran,

226
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:12,360
my college classmate.

227
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:13,960
He works in semiconductors.

228
00:10:14,150 --> 00:10:15,050
Hello, Yun Li.

229
00:10:15,940 --> 00:10:16,740
Hello.

230
00:10:16,940 --> 00:10:18,050
This is Lu Yu.

231
00:10:18,150 --> 00:10:19,130
He works in AI;

232
00:10:19,130 --> 00:10:20,290
also my college classmate.

233
00:10:20,290 --> 00:10:21,100
Hello.

234
00:10:23,630 --> 00:10:24,490
This is my brother,

235
00:10:24,490 --> 00:10:25,070
Fu Zhengchu,

236
00:10:25,070 --> 00:10:26,670
currently studying at NUST.

237
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:28,290
Wow,

238
00:10:28,340 --> 00:10:29,340
an elite student!

239
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:31,530
No, not at all.

240
00:10:32,390 --> 00:10:33,610
Don't praise him.

241
00:10:33,640 --> 00:10:35,380
It'll go straight to his head.

242
00:10:37,210 --> 00:10:38,710
Lili's the amazing one.

243
00:10:38,740 --> 00:10:40,150
She's a content creator on EAW,

244
00:10:40,150 --> 00:10:41,460
with tons of followers.

245
00:10:41,460 --> 00:10:42,250
Tangy, stop it.

246
00:10:42,250 --> 00:10:43,000
Really?

247
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,100
I'm on EAW a lot.

248
00:10:44,130 --> 00:10:44,960
What's your username?

249
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:45,890
I'll follow you.

250
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:48,240
I... um...

251
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,030
Excuse me.

252
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,240
Let's go.

253
00:11:01,390 --> 00:11:02,950
I'll help you with your luggage.

254
00:11:02,950 --> 00:11:04,010
I'll see you later.

255
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:07,760
This is my brother, Xu Qingsong.

256
00:11:07,790 --> 00:11:08,930
Hello.

257
00:11:09,940 --> 00:11:10,750
Let's go too.

258
00:11:10,750 --> 00:11:11,280
Let's go.

259
00:11:11,340 --> 00:11:11,870
Let's go.

260
00:11:11,910 --> 00:11:12,370
Go!

261
00:11:25,930 --> 00:11:26,720
Thanks.

262
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:32,030
Lili!

263
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:42,390
Lili.

264
00:11:43,790 --> 00:11:46,270
Why didn't you tell me
there were other people?

265
00:11:46,270 --> 00:11:47,820
Those are Xia's friends.

266
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:50,050
They happen to be returning to Nanwu,

267
00:11:50,050 --> 00:11:52,410
so we just... came together.

268
00:11:54,290 --> 00:11:55,000
On their own,

269
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:56,860
they're nice, clean-cut guys.

270
00:11:57,130 --> 00:11:58,440
But compared to the three

271
00:11:58,440 --> 00:11:59,270
you came with,

272
00:11:59,270 --> 00:12:00,960
they do fall a bit short.

273
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:03,320
But...

274
00:12:03,630 --> 00:12:05,010
While good looks are a gift,

275
00:12:05,010 --> 00:12:06,500
good character is a choice.

276
00:12:06,500 --> 00:12:07,720
Don't just judge them

277
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:08,920
by their appearance.

278
00:12:09,550 --> 00:12:10,250
What did you

279
00:12:10,250 --> 00:12:11,200
tell them?

280
00:12:13,630 --> 00:12:15,960
I only said you were single.

281
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,390
I...

282
00:12:21,340 --> 00:12:22,430
Lili,

283
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:24,520
I'm doing this for your own good.

284
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:25,750
You can't

285
00:12:25,750 --> 00:12:26,960
put all your eggs in one basket.

286
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:28,030
You should get out there

287
00:12:28,030 --> 00:12:29,200
and meet other guys.

288
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:30,630
It might

289
00:12:30,630 --> 00:12:31,840
help you move on from

290
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:33,770
the whole situation with Fu Shize.

291
00:12:34,740 --> 00:12:35,530
Lili!

292
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:38,000
Am I right?

293
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:39,390
Yes.

294
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:44,890
What year

295
00:12:44,890 --> 00:12:46,690
of college did we play this game?

296
00:12:47,090 --> 00:12:48,020
Sophomore year?

297
00:12:48,250 --> 00:12:49,510
End of sophomore year.

298
00:12:49,770 --> 00:12:50,270
Right.

299
00:12:50,300 --> 00:12:52,390
He even missed his assignment deadline.

300
00:12:52,390 --> 00:12:53,000
Yun Li!

301
00:12:53,540 --> 00:12:54,080
Sit here.

302
00:12:54,220 --> 00:12:54,750
You're here.

303
00:12:54,750 --> 00:12:56,150
It's okay. I'll sit here.

304
00:13:00,410 --> 00:13:01,050
I'm asking Uncle

305
00:13:01,050 --> 00:13:02,310
when he's coming over.

306
00:13:04,930 --> 00:13:05,660
-Tangy.
-Hi.

307
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:08,600
I saved you a seat.

308
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:09,340
Sit here.

309
00:13:13,050 --> 00:13:13,860
Have a drink.

310
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:15,390
Why are you sitting there?

311
00:13:15,390 --> 00:13:16,890
I sit wherever I want.

312
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:18,490
It's none of your business.

313
00:13:40,270 --> 00:13:41,120
Uncle.

314
00:13:42,030 --> 00:13:42,890
Looking good.

315
00:13:42,960 --> 00:13:44,200
Qingsong's clothes actually

316
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:45,460
suit you so well.

317
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,800
I don't have a change of clothes.

318
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:52,890
Stop staring.

319
00:14:04,630 --> 00:14:05,440
Lili,

320
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:06,130
this sofa is huge.

321
00:14:06,130 --> 00:14:08,060
Why are you suddenly so close to me?

322
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:11,860
I feel more at ease next to you.

323
00:14:16,530 --> 00:14:17,340
So?

324
00:14:17,530 --> 00:14:19,390
Any idea what we should play?

325
00:14:19,940 --> 00:14:21,250
I just unboxed a new game:

326
00:14:21,250 --> 00:14:22,360
Halli Galli.

327
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:23,650
This is fun.

328
00:14:23,740 --> 00:14:26,000
It tests your reflexes. Super exciting.

329
00:14:26,340 --> 00:14:27,390
What are the rules?

330
00:14:27,390 --> 00:14:28,550
The rules are simple.

331
00:14:28,550 --> 00:14:30,200
Everyone takes turns flipping a card.

332
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,030
Once there are

333
00:14:31,030 --> 00:14:32,530
five of the same fruit on the table,

334
00:14:32,530 --> 00:14:33,940
you have to ring the bell.

335
00:14:34,390 --> 00:14:35,310
The last to ring the bell

336
00:14:35,310 --> 00:14:37,220
has to give everyone else a card.

337
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:38,240
In the end,

338
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:39,750
the one with the most cards wins.

339
00:14:39,750 --> 00:14:40,550
Wait!

340
00:14:43,630 --> 00:14:44,630
I want to sit here.

341
00:14:44,650 --> 00:14:46,580
Why did you suddenly change seats?

342
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:49,290
I'm... afraid you'll cheat.

343
00:14:49,290 --> 00:14:50,150
I'll watch you.

344
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:51,550
Are you serious?

345
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:53,500
How can you cheat in this game?

346
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:55,100
I don't care.

347
00:14:55,700 --> 00:14:56,500
Let's start.

348
00:14:57,390 --> 00:14:58,100
Yun Li,

349
00:14:58,240 --> 00:14:59,700
did you understand the rules?

350
00:14:59,700 --> 00:15:01,430
Or should I repeat them for you?

351
00:15:02,170 --> 00:15:02,980
Actually...

352
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:04,030
Let's start.

353
00:15:05,250 --> 00:15:06,200
Ready?

354
00:15:06,200 --> 00:15:07,250
I'll start.

355
00:15:17,650 --> 00:15:18,460
Uncle,

356
00:15:19,030 --> 00:15:20,150
how are you so fast?

357
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:21,420
Come on, continue.

358
00:15:23,750 --> 00:15:24,610
Strawberries!

359
00:15:34,170 --> 00:15:35,150
Hey, Chen,

360
00:15:35,150 --> 00:15:36,480
you're pretty good too.

361
00:15:38,870 --> 00:15:40,010
What do you mean, "Chen"?

362
00:15:40,010 --> 00:15:41,070
Are you that close?

363
00:15:42,140 --> 00:15:43,400
Oh, shut up.

364
00:15:44,940 --> 00:15:45,400
Flip your card.

365
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:46,200
Continue.

366
00:15:53,760 --> 00:15:55,330
Ouch! Fu Zhengchu!

367
00:15:55,360 --> 00:15:56,580
Do you have to hit so hard?

368
00:15:56,580 --> 00:15:57,840
Are you born stubborn?

369
00:15:58,170 --> 00:15:59,370
It hurts.

370
00:16:02,290 --> 00:16:04,200
What are you two doing?

371
00:16:11,100 --> 00:16:12,030
It doesn't hurt.

372
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:15,220
I feel nothing.

373
00:16:16,700 --> 00:16:18,900
Is this the famous fight to be the alpha?

374
00:16:25,380 --> 00:16:26,000
Come on.

375
00:16:26,020 --> 00:16:26,930
Again, again.

376
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:27,460
Go.

377
00:16:43,750 --> 00:16:44,500
Lili,

378
00:16:44,500 --> 00:16:46,010
you don't have many cards left.

379
00:16:46,010 --> 00:16:47,070
You have to step up.

380
00:16:54,750 --> 00:16:55,510
Uncle,

381
00:16:55,510 --> 00:16:57,100
there aren't five fruits.

382
00:16:57,100 --> 00:16:58,910
It's a foul to ring the bell.

383
00:16:58,910 --> 00:16:59,910
Take the penalty.

384
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:01,910
My bad.

385
00:17:04,900 --> 00:17:05,849
Let's continue.

386
00:17:06,900 --> 00:17:07,829
Whose turn is it?

387
00:17:19,609 --> 00:17:20,420
Uncle,

388
00:17:20,609 --> 00:17:21,660
why are you

389
00:17:21,660 --> 00:17:23,119
suddenly so slow to react?

390
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:48,820
Why don't we...

391
00:17:50,160 --> 00:17:51,200
play another game?

392
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:51,750
What?

393
00:17:51,750 --> 00:17:52,250
I'm finally

394
00:17:52,250 --> 00:17:53,310
not the loser.

395
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:55,050
Let's play a bit more.

396
00:17:55,050 --> 00:17:55,790
I...

397
00:17:55,790 --> 00:17:57,450
Let's switch. Enough of this.

398
00:17:57,610 --> 00:17:58,810
Then let's switch.

399
00:17:58,960 --> 00:18:00,200
What should we play?

400
00:18:00,220 --> 00:18:01,680
Let's play High Card Draw.

401
00:18:02,010 --> 00:18:03,640
The person with the highest card

402
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:04,800
can ask

403
00:18:04,820 --> 00:18:06,320
anyone here a question.

404
00:18:06,590 --> 00:18:08,120
It's simple and thrilling.

405
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:10,950
Well, I brought a bottle of red wine.

406
00:18:10,950 --> 00:18:11,740
I'll bring it over

407
00:18:11,740 --> 00:18:12,460
to spice things up.

408
00:18:12,460 --> 00:18:13,010
Sure.

409
00:18:13,010 --> 00:18:13,660
Okay.

410
00:18:15,200 --> 00:18:16,290
Put this away.

411
00:18:21,160 --> 00:18:21,550
No thanks.

412
00:18:21,550 --> 00:18:23,500
I-I'll drink orange juice.

413
00:18:23,610 --> 00:18:24,400
It's fine.

414
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:26,600
Hold onto it. You can have a taste later.

415
00:18:27,660 --> 00:18:29,350
None for me, thanks.

416
00:18:30,270 --> 00:18:30,850
Okay.

417
00:18:43,610 --> 00:18:45,010
Then let's start.

418
00:18:45,400 --> 00:18:46,510
-Come on.
-Okay.

419
00:18:53,460 --> 00:18:54,590
No need to look.

420
00:18:54,850 --> 00:18:56,180
I'm winning this round.

421
00:18:56,220 --> 00:18:58,020
I have the highest card, don't I?

422
00:18:58,050 --> 00:18:58,850
I lost.

423
00:19:00,010 --> 00:19:01,810
Go on and ask someone a question.

424
00:19:04,660 --> 00:19:05,900
Chen,

425
00:19:06,790 --> 00:19:07,750
are you single?

426
00:19:10,610 --> 00:19:11,420
Yes.

427
00:19:12,400 --> 00:19:13,550
Oh, single!

428
00:19:18,820 --> 00:19:19,610
Come on.

429
00:19:19,980 --> 00:19:20,550
Continue.

430
00:19:20,550 --> 00:19:21,090
Another round.

431
00:19:21,090 --> 00:19:22,550
Three, two, one!

432
00:19:22,550 --> 00:19:24,010
-Ten.
-Eight.

433
00:19:24,460 --> 00:19:25,090
I got a Q.

434
00:19:27,920 --> 00:19:28,750
Then you ask.

435
00:19:29,660 --> 00:19:30,460
Yun Li,

436
00:19:31,220 --> 00:19:32,090
among

437
00:19:32,350 --> 00:19:33,420
everyone here,

438
00:19:33,750 --> 00:19:35,480
who are you most interested in?

439
00:19:48,090 --> 00:19:48,880
No one.

440
00:19:49,250 --> 00:19:50,750
If you have to name one?

441
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:52,620
You can only ask one question.

442
00:19:54,340 --> 00:19:55,010
Come on.

443
00:19:55,010 --> 00:19:56,200
Another round.

444
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:56,790
Come on.

445
00:19:56,790 --> 00:19:57,650
Next round.

446
00:19:57,680 --> 00:19:58,140
Come on.

447
00:20:08,450 --> 00:20:09,450
Jackpot!

448
00:20:09,700 --> 00:20:10,220
Q!

449
00:20:12,480 --> 00:20:13,200
He got a K.

450
00:20:15,330 --> 00:20:16,720
Finally won a round.

451
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:20,730
Then I'll ask Yun Li too.

452
00:20:22,740 --> 00:20:24,940
Among everyone here, who do you think is

453
00:20:25,900 --> 00:20:26,900
the best looking?

454
00:20:30,960 --> 00:20:31,750
Fu Zhengchu!

455
00:20:34,790 --> 00:20:35,550
Me?

456
00:20:38,240 --> 00:20:39,440
I'm the best looking?

457
00:20:52,830 --> 00:20:53,640
Next round.

458
00:20:54,250 --> 00:20:55,050
You all go on.

459
00:20:55,590 --> 00:20:56,790
I need to get some air.

460
00:21:03,980 --> 00:21:05,740
I suddenly feel a bit tired.

461
00:21:05,880 --> 00:21:06,880
I'll go to my room.

462
00:21:06,900 --> 00:21:07,730
Have fun.

463
00:21:08,180 --> 00:21:09,350
There's a hot spring in the room.

464
00:21:09,350 --> 00:21:10,460
You can use it.

465
00:21:10,500 --> 00:21:11,420
Lili, what about you?

466
00:21:11,420 --> 00:21:12,500
I'll go with you.

467
00:21:13,140 --> 00:21:13,670
Let's go.

468
00:21:13,830 --> 00:21:15,030
Then I'll go back too.

469
00:21:15,070 --> 00:21:15,790
I'll take a bath.

470
00:21:15,790 --> 00:21:16,180
Bye.

471
00:21:16,250 --> 00:21:16,530
Let's go.

472
00:21:16,530 --> 00:21:16,810
Okay.

473
00:21:16,810 --> 00:21:17,160
-Bye.
-Bye.

474
00:21:17,160 --> 00:21:17,830
I'll be going too.

475
00:21:17,830 --> 00:21:18,490
Bye!

476
00:21:18,510 --> 00:21:19,530
You're leaving too?

477
00:21:19,530 --> 00:21:20,420
Bye.

478
00:21:20,420 --> 00:21:21,310
See you.

479
00:21:21,590 --> 00:21:22,550
The three of us can continue.

480
00:21:22,550 --> 00:21:23,210
Let's go on.

481
00:21:36,250 --> 00:21:38,380
You really know how to enjoy yourself.

482
00:21:44,120 --> 00:21:44,920
What's wrong?

483
00:21:45,960 --> 00:21:47,000
In a bad mood?

484
00:21:48,440 --> 00:21:49,840
Didn't she always say...

485
00:21:51,330 --> 00:21:53,390
I'm better looking than Fu Zhengchu?

486
00:21:54,700 --> 00:21:56,630
Is this what's been bothering you?

487
00:22:02,250 --> 00:22:03,180
Since when do you

488
00:22:03,830 --> 00:22:05,890
care so much about what others think?

489
00:22:11,940 --> 00:22:12,850
Do you really think

490
00:22:12,850 --> 00:22:14,650
Fu Zhengchu's the best looking?

491
00:22:15,480 --> 00:22:17,330
Can you not expose me?

492
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:20,240
I knew

493
00:22:20,330 --> 00:22:22,090
your taste wasn't that bad.

494
00:22:22,900 --> 00:22:24,030
Then choose again.

495
00:22:26,330 --> 00:22:27,400
I choose...

496
00:22:29,250 --> 00:22:30,050
Mr. Xu.

497
00:22:30,500 --> 00:22:31,760
Think again.

498
00:22:32,850 --> 00:22:34,050
I think that Chen guy

499
00:22:34,050 --> 00:22:35,070
is decent.

500
00:22:41,220 --> 00:22:42,460
Of course,

501
00:22:43,250 --> 00:22:45,660
Fu Shize wore a floral shirt today.

502
00:22:46,180 --> 00:22:47,610
He did look really good.

503
00:22:51,790 --> 00:22:52,530
Don't tell me

504
00:22:52,530 --> 00:22:53,850
you're obsessed with him again

505
00:22:53,850 --> 00:22:54,460
just because

506
00:22:54,460 --> 00:22:55,860
of a stupid floral shirt.

507
00:22:56,440 --> 00:22:57,250
I'm not

508
00:22:57,250 --> 00:22:58,500
that shallow!

509
00:22:58,900 --> 00:23:00,100
That'd better be true!

510
00:23:00,100 --> 00:23:00,630
Tang Lin!

511
00:23:08,270 --> 00:23:10,220
Do you remember

512
00:23:11,050 --> 00:23:13,590
that Fu Shize wanted to ask out

513
00:23:13,590 --> 00:23:15,030
a girl he's known

514
00:23:15,030 --> 00:23:15,960
for a long time?

515
00:23:16,480 --> 00:23:17,140
I remember.

516
00:23:17,220 --> 00:23:17,920
Why?

517
00:23:18,310 --> 00:23:20,070
But Fu Zhengchu said that people

518
00:23:20,070 --> 00:23:21,140
he's known for a long time

519
00:23:21,140 --> 00:23:22,380
are all blood relatives.

520
00:23:22,380 --> 00:23:23,000
So,

521
00:23:23,460 --> 00:23:25,720
did... did I misunderstand him?

522
00:23:26,530 --> 00:23:27,850
Even if it was a misunderstanding,

523
00:23:27,850 --> 00:23:29,910
he's been rejecting you up until now.

524
00:23:33,220 --> 00:23:33,920
Lili.

525
00:23:34,810 --> 00:23:35,960
I think that Chen guy

526
00:23:35,960 --> 00:23:37,220
is quite fond of you.

527
00:23:38,350 --> 00:23:39,570
You need to know

528
00:23:39,750 --> 00:23:41,220
that you're very popular.

529
00:23:41,220 --> 00:23:42,880
Stop mentioning him.

530
00:23:43,160 --> 00:23:44,620
Why don't you just ask him?

531
00:23:44,670 --> 00:23:46,090
You're just torturing yourself

532
00:23:46,090 --> 00:23:47,390
by dwelling on this.

533
00:23:48,830 --> 00:23:50,180
But he's rejected me

534
00:23:50,180 --> 00:23:51,220
so many times.

535
00:23:51,680 --> 00:23:52,940
Wouldn't asking again

536
00:23:53,010 --> 00:23:54,540
just make me look pathetic?

537
00:24:01,160 --> 00:24:02,010
Lili,

538
00:24:02,680 --> 00:24:03,880
I didn't know

539
00:24:04,050 --> 00:24:06,250
you've been hiding such a great figure!

540
00:24:06,330 --> 00:24:07,050
Tangy!

541
00:24:14,460 --> 00:24:15,220
Who's that?

542
00:24:18,290 --> 00:24:18,850
I...

543
00:24:31,940 --> 00:24:33,810
Here, have a drink.

544
00:24:39,980 --> 00:24:42,510
About the restaurant thing
you mentioned...

545
00:24:44,960 --> 00:24:46,410
Jiameng told Yun Li?

546
00:24:53,250 --> 00:24:56,110
Well, didn't I help you
fend off an unwanted suitor?

547
00:25:02,940 --> 00:25:04,940
I'm going to die of embarrassment.

548
00:25:05,430 --> 00:25:09,360
Oh my gosh, they heard everything.

549
00:25:13,350 --> 00:25:15,720
I think you shouldn't overthink it.

550
00:25:16,020 --> 00:25:17,370
Maybe they didn't

551
00:25:17,390 --> 00:25:18,540
even hear anything.

552
00:25:19,220 --> 00:25:21,020
T-They even knocked on the wall.

553
00:25:22,460 --> 00:25:23,960
Even if they heard us,

554
00:25:24,510 --> 00:25:25,720
it's no big deal.

555
00:25:25,960 --> 00:25:27,220
It is a big deal!

556
00:25:27,220 --> 00:25:29,480
Oh my gosh, just kill me!

557
00:25:29,480 --> 00:25:31,010
I was embarrassing
when I was chasing him,

558
00:25:31,010 --> 00:25:32,960
and I'm still embarrassing
when I'm not chasing him.

559
00:25:32,960 --> 00:25:33,880
Gosh,

560
00:25:33,880 --> 00:25:35,510
I'm just a huge embarrassment.

561
00:25:35,510 --> 00:25:36,310
There, there.

562
00:25:42,720 --> 00:25:44,180
Xia asked us to play cards.

563
00:25:44,460 --> 00:25:45,750
I'm not going.

564
00:25:46,570 --> 00:25:47,830
Then I won't go either.

565
00:26:51,570 --> 00:26:52,530
But he's rejected me

566
00:26:52,530 --> 00:26:53,510
so many times.

567
00:26:53,720 --> 00:26:54,880
Wouldn't asking again

568
00:26:54,880 --> 00:26:56,410
just make me look pathetic?

569
00:28:21,250 --> 00:28:21,910
Just got up?

570
00:28:25,180 --> 00:28:26,840
Wanna have breakfast with me?

571
00:28:33,440 --> 00:28:34,900
They're wrapping up soon.

572
00:28:41,220 --> 00:28:41,980
Thanks.

573
00:28:45,810 --> 00:28:47,340
There's nothing much left.

574
00:28:54,750 --> 00:28:55,720
Want some toast?

575
00:28:55,960 --> 00:28:57,570
Oh, I can do it myself.

576
00:28:59,260 --> 00:29:00,060
Thanks.

577
00:29:03,850 --> 00:29:04,850
Take a seat.

578
00:29:05,050 --> 00:29:06,110
I'll bring it over.

579
00:29:06,310 --> 00:29:07,550
Okay, thanks.

580
00:29:38,080 --> 00:29:39,210
What a coincidence.

581
00:29:40,110 --> 00:29:41,050
Can I sit here?

582
00:29:41,050 --> 00:29:43,610
Fu Shize... is toasting the bread.

583
00:29:51,010 --> 00:29:53,550
Are you two in the talking stage?

584
00:29:59,250 --> 00:30:00,050
You're late.

585
00:30:00,070 --> 00:30:01,050
There's nothing much left.

586
00:30:01,050 --> 00:30:01,660
How about

587
00:30:01,660 --> 00:30:02,880
I take you out to eat?

588
00:30:13,180 --> 00:30:13,980
Thanks.

589
00:30:14,140 --> 00:30:15,570
I'll just have the toast.

590
00:30:26,920 --> 00:30:27,590
Thanks.

591
00:30:31,810 --> 00:30:33,250
I warmed it with boiling water,

592
00:30:33,250 --> 00:30:34,250
so it took a while.

593
00:30:40,310 --> 00:30:41,920
Just coffee for breakfast?

594
00:30:41,920 --> 00:30:42,720
That won't do.

595
00:30:42,720 --> 00:30:43,780
H-Here, have this.

596
00:30:46,520 --> 00:30:47,070
And this.

597
00:30:47,070 --> 00:30:48,110
I didn't touch it.

598
00:30:52,770 --> 00:30:53,240
Thanks.

599
00:31:02,980 --> 00:31:04,460
I... I forgot my bag.

600
00:31:04,610 --> 00:31:05,420
I...

601
00:31:05,480 --> 00:31:06,660
Where we just ate?

602
00:31:07,510 --> 00:31:08,380
I'll go.

603
00:31:15,110 --> 00:31:15,810
Yun Li.

604
00:31:19,070 --> 00:31:20,270
Waiting for someone?

605
00:31:23,010 --> 00:31:24,500
I just want to confirm this—

606
00:31:24,500 --> 00:31:26,930
you're not dating anyone,

607
00:31:27,250 --> 00:31:28,050
right?

608
00:31:30,650 --> 00:31:31,300
Okay.

609
00:31:31,810 --> 00:31:33,270
I'll be straightforward.

610
00:31:33,580 --> 00:31:34,840
I'm interested in you.

611
00:31:35,550 --> 00:31:36,920
But if you like someone else,

612
00:31:36,920 --> 00:31:37,610
or if

613
00:31:38,250 --> 00:31:39,460
you're in a relationship,

614
00:31:39,460 --> 00:31:40,550
please tell me.

615
00:31:41,420 --> 00:31:43,350
Let's not waste each other's time.

616
00:31:43,720 --> 00:31:45,180
You and Congsheng's uncle

617
00:31:45,180 --> 00:31:46,840
are clearly not just friends.

618
00:31:47,460 --> 00:31:49,070
If you're flirting with him

619
00:31:49,130 --> 00:31:50,460
just to

620
00:31:50,490 --> 00:31:51,070
reject me,

621
00:31:51,070 --> 00:31:52,380
it's completely unnecessary.

622
00:31:52,380 --> 00:31:53,220
How are we

623
00:31:53,220 --> 00:31:54,680
not just friends?

624
00:31:54,720 --> 00:31:56,650
What kind of friends act like this?

625
00:31:58,110 --> 00:31:58,920
Let's go.

626
00:32:06,310 --> 00:32:07,440
What's on your mind?

627
00:32:09,180 --> 00:32:09,960
I'm...

628
00:32:12,590 --> 00:32:15,120
thinking about how
friends should interact.

629
00:32:16,050 --> 00:32:18,050
The grove's decorated with lights.

630
00:32:21,160 --> 00:32:22,820
They turn it on during dinner.

631
00:32:25,750 --> 00:32:26,280
Let's go.

632
00:32:36,510 --> 00:32:37,070
Lili,

633
00:32:37,100 --> 00:32:38,660
are you really going to stay in?

634
00:32:38,660 --> 00:32:39,480
Yeah.

635
00:32:39,480 --> 00:32:40,310
I must finish

636
00:32:40,310 --> 00:32:41,480
editing this today.

637
00:32:41,680 --> 00:32:42,810
I'll get going then.

638
00:32:43,370 --> 00:32:43,880
Bye.

639
00:32:43,880 --> 00:32:44,740
Go ahead.

640
00:33:00,880 --> 00:33:01,740
Upload!

641
00:33:52,380 --> 00:33:54,380
The grove's decorated with lights.

642
00:33:54,460 --> 00:33:56,120
They turn it on during dinner.

643
00:34:52,880 --> 00:34:53,980
Don't catch a cold.

644
00:34:55,360 --> 00:34:56,150
You're here.

645
00:34:57,730 --> 00:34:59,170
Have you been drinking?

646
00:35:20,000 --> 00:35:21,060
Join me for a while.

647
00:35:43,710 --> 00:35:45,350
♪ I grew used to ♪

648
00:35:45,370 --> 00:35:48,780
♪ Keeping a polite distance ♪

649
00:35:50,760 --> 00:35:52,970
♪ Until you came along ♪

650
00:35:53,160 --> 00:35:56,740
♪ And messed up all my logic ♪

651
00:35:58,550 --> 00:36:00,730
♪ I once thought it through carefully ♪

652
00:36:00,770 --> 00:36:05,010
♪ The breath drawn as I lean in
on purpose ♪

653
00:36:06,090 --> 00:36:07,840
♪ When I stand right beside you ♪

654
00:36:07,870 --> 00:36:12,440
♪ Even silence starts to mean something ♪

655
00:36:14,040 --> 00:36:16,990
♪ I know those fears ♪

656
00:36:17,020 --> 00:36:20,360
♪ May never truly fade away ♪

657
00:36:21,770 --> 00:36:24,400
♪ Still I choose to stay ♪

658
00:36:24,430 --> 00:36:27,440
♪ On your page ♪

659
00:36:29,680 --> 00:36:31,380
♪ It's you ♪

660
00:36:31,480 --> 00:36:33,680
♪ Even with my eyes closed ♪

661
00:36:33,720 --> 00:36:34,870
♪ Just you ♪

662
00:36:34,900 --> 00:36:37,550
♪ You are the instinct I can't quit ♪

663
00:36:35,550 --> 00:36:37,280
Are you not chasing me anymore?

664
00:36:37,660 --> 00:36:39,040
♪ It's always you ♪

665
00:36:39,060 --> 00:36:41,380
♪ Who bring faded colors back to life ♪

666
00:36:41,400 --> 00:36:44,670
♪ And keep me company through
the endless night ♪

667
00:36:45,360 --> 00:36:46,730
♪ It's you ♪

668
00:36:46,760 --> 00:36:48,730
♪ Even if I forget everything ♪

669
00:36:48,760 --> 00:36:49,980
♪ Just you ♪

670
00:36:50,010 --> 00:36:52,980
♪ All my heart defaults to ♪

671
00:36:53,010 --> 00:36:53,960
♪ It's always you ♪

672
00:36:53,970 --> 00:36:55,050
♪ You warm ♪

673
00:36:55,080 --> 00:36:57,760
♪ Every ordinary season ♪

674
00:36:55,760 --> 00:36:59,500
Why are you asking me this
all of a sudden?

675
00:36:58,630 --> 00:37:01,510
♪ It's you ♪

676
00:37:07,010 --> 00:37:08,150
Still don't get it?

677
00:37:11,890 --> 00:37:13,840
♪ If sometimes ♪

678
00:37:13,870 --> 00:37:17,670
♪ You feel discouraged ♪

679
00:37:17,380 --> 00:37:19,010
The person they said

680
00:37:18,930 --> 00:37:20,930
♪ I'll be behind you ♪

681
00:37:19,050 --> 00:37:20,710
you wanted to ask out...

682
00:37:20,710 --> 00:37:21,380
Is you.

683
00:37:20,960 --> 00:37:24,990
♪ To protect your uneasy past ♪

684
00:37:26,560 --> 00:37:28,930
♪ I don't need anyone to prove ♪

685
00:37:27,260 --> 00:37:28,460
It's always been you.

686
00:37:28,960 --> 00:37:32,440
♪ Whether I win in this adventure ♪

687
00:37:33,860 --> 00:37:36,040
♪ Let me draw near again ♪

688
00:37:33,900 --> 00:37:35,560
The person I want to ask out...

689
00:37:36,090 --> 00:37:40,600
♪ Every little bit of your heart ♪

690
00:37:38,840 --> 00:37:39,970
has always been you.

691
00:37:42,200 --> 00:37:45,670
♪ I know those fears ♪

692
00:37:45,700 --> 00:37:48,600
♪ May never truly fade away ♪

693
00:37:49,850 --> 00:37:52,840
♪ Still I choose to stay ♪

694
00:37:52,860 --> 00:37:55,440
♪ On this page ♪

695
00:37:54,280 --> 00:37:55,510
You're drunk.

696
00:37:57,360 --> 00:37:58,130
I'm not.

697
00:37:57,960 --> 00:38:00,880
♪ It's you ♪

698
00:38:00,170 --> 00:38:00,670
No, no.

699
00:38:00,670 --> 00:38:02,550
Y-You just had too much to drink.

700
00:38:07,300 --> 00:38:07,880
Fine.

701
00:38:10,030 --> 00:38:11,460
If you think I'm drunk,

702
00:38:13,840 --> 00:38:14,480
I can say it again

703
00:38:14,480 --> 00:38:15,880
when I'm sober tomorrow.

704
00:38:18,130 --> 00:38:19,530
I'm going back to my room.

705
00:38:20,230 --> 00:38:21,320
This is for you.

706
00:38:22,940 --> 00:38:25,270
Can you wait two minutes before you leave?

707
00:38:25,590 --> 00:38:26,990
I came out alone.

708
00:38:29,520 --> 00:38:30,040
Yeah.

709
00:38:42,070 --> 00:38:43,530
When you wake up tomorrow,

710
00:38:44,530 --> 00:38:46,530
will what you just said still count?

711
00:38:50,360 --> 00:38:51,170
It will.

712
00:38:55,380 --> 00:38:56,840
Then can you stop drinking

713
00:38:56,840 --> 00:38:58,110
the rest of your wine?

714
00:39:02,680 --> 00:39:03,210
Mm.

715
00:39:07,170 --> 00:39:08,280
I'm taking it.

716
00:39:24,720 --> 00:39:26,890
Did... Didn't you say

717
00:39:26,920 --> 00:39:28,850
you don't have a change of clothes?

718
00:39:34,030 --> 00:39:35,030
You said...

719
00:39:36,780 --> 00:39:38,830
Xu Qingsong dresses better.

720
00:39:39,170 --> 00:39:42,440
You wore it for me?

721
00:39:47,260 --> 00:39:48,010
Good night.

722
00:41:08,260 --> 00:41:09,050
Not bad.

723
00:41:09,650 --> 00:41:11,580
You only drank half a bottle today.

724
00:41:24,050 --> 00:41:24,980
Where did you go?

725
00:41:25,460 --> 00:41:26,260
To confess.

726
00:41:28,170 --> 00:41:29,100
To confess?

727
00:41:31,420 --> 00:41:32,280
To Yun Li?

728
00:41:34,000 --> 00:41:34,780
No wonder you

729
00:41:34,780 --> 00:41:37,180
insisted on wearing my clothes yesterday.

730
00:41:37,800 --> 00:41:38,400
Then...

731
00:41:39,150 --> 00:41:39,900
am I

732
00:41:39,900 --> 00:41:41,300
interrupting you two?

733
00:41:41,300 --> 00:41:41,920
Nope.

734
00:41:43,090 --> 00:41:44,030
This is nice too.

735
00:41:48,510 --> 00:41:50,050
Is that a token of love

736
00:41:50,420 --> 00:41:51,800
in your hands?

737
00:41:53,230 --> 00:41:53,650
Mm.

738
00:41:54,110 --> 00:41:54,920
Let me see.

739
00:42:18,400 --> 00:42:20,330
Take her to the aquarium tomorrow.

740
00:42:20,860 --> 00:42:22,050
You can use my car.

741
00:42:24,720 --> 00:42:26,520
Remember to bring a little gift.

742
00:42:31,210 --> 00:42:32,140
[Wanna go to the aquarium tomorrow?]

743
00:42:32,140 --> 00:42:33,300
[(Not sent)
Wanna go to the aquarium tomorrow?]
